(4052353, 580845, 53572, '<td valign="top">a lovely picture, and well laid out graphics.  however, i do wish you''d checked the grammar - it should be ''<i><b>its</b></i>'', not ''<i>it''s</i>''.  ''<i>it''s</i>'' is a contraction of <i>it is</i>, not the possessive of it.  i''m not marking you down for it, but it is pretty important on a poster.</td>', 'a lovely picture, and well laid out graphics.  however, i do wish you''d checked the grammar - it should be ''its'', not ''it''s''.  ''it''s'' is a contraction of it is, not the possessive of it.  i''m not marking you down for it, but it is pretty important on a poster.', '2007-09-03 07:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052356, 579490, 53572, '<td valign="top">a very nice image (sherpet?), well composed, with good graphic lay out too.  i just wish you had checked the grammar - it should be <b><i>Nature''s</i></b> - that''s the possesive of Nature - what you have here is the plural.</td>', 'a very nice image (sherpet?), well composed, with good graphic lay out too.  i just wish you had checked the grammar - it should be Nature''s - that''s the possesive of Nature - what you have here is the plural.', '2007-09-03 07:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
