(4052766, 580965, 49109, '<td valign="top">not the most original idea, but very well executed; great colors and sharpness, beautiful gradient created through the light from top to bottom. Good layout, border color is too muddy, choice of typeface for "Henry Ford" is questionable.</td>', 'not the most original idea, but very well executed; great colors and sharpness, beautiful gradient created through the light from top to bottom. Good layout, border color is too muddy, choice of typeface for "Henry Ford" is questionable.', '2007-09-03 10:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
