(4052955, 581075, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice one - though it doesn''t motivate me to think differently about women, it surely stands out as different! Maybe useful for a feminist campaign. <br/>[ and yes i do fold them myself :-)]8</td>', 'Nice one - though it doesn''t motivate me to think differently about women, it surely stands out as different! Maybe useful for a feminist campaign. [ and yes i do fold them myself :-)]8', '2007-09-03 11:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052958, 580965, 54446, '<td valign="top">I love the photo.  The TEAMWORK text is very good.  The small text quote is not a positive.  The frame is not a positive, as it reduces the viewable portion of the image.  In this case, less would have been more.  I''m still voting this a "9" based on the excellent photo.</td>', 'I love the photo.  The TEAMWORK text is very good.  The small text quote is not a positive.  The frame is not a positive, as it reduces the viewable portion of the image.  In this case, less would have been more.  I''m still voting this a "9" based on the excellent photo.', '2007-09-03 11:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052960, 580708, 54446, '<td valign="top">A unique photo.  Great capture.  Excellent illustration of your title.  I like it.  (9)</td>', 'A unique photo.  Great capture.  Excellent illustration of your title.  I like it.  (9)', '2007-09-03 11:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052961, 580766, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Good lighting and detail.  This frame is one of the few which actually adds something to the presentation.  (9)</td>', 'Well done!  Good lighting and detail.  This frame is one of the few which actually adds something to the presentation.  (9)', '2007-09-03 11:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052962, 581080, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Cool image.  There are some distractions, but nothing too serious.  I guess I like the message/image combination so much, it overrides minor technical difficulties.  (9)</td>', 'Great capture.  Cool image.  There are some distractions, but nothing too serious.  I guess I like the message/image combination so much, it overrides minor technical difficulties.  (9)', '2007-09-03 11:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
