(4055102, 580965, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice presentation but lacks originality.</td>', 'Very nice presentation but lacks originality.', '2007-09-04 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055105, 578944, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  Fitting slogan, but not very motivational.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  Fitting slogan, but not very motivational.', '2007-09-04 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055110, 580805, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and a good idea. All the elements are good just not sure if the negative space works well here. Still it gets a good score from me. Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice photo and a good idea. All the elements are good just not sure if the negative space works well here. Still it gets a good score from me. Good luck.', '2007-09-04 00:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055115, 580338, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective. Could have better lighting but otherwise pretty good.</td>', 'Cool perspective. Could have better lighting but otherwise pretty good.', '2007-09-04 00:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055123, 578887, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this is meant to motivate me into stopping bureaucracy, but it is interesting. Something a bit different.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this is meant to motivate me into stopping bureaucracy, but it is interesting. Something a bit different.', '2007-09-04 00:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055126, 581021, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like everything about this.</td>', 'Nice, I like everything about this.', '2007-09-04 00:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055127, 581079, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Very cute. Nice lighting.', '2007-09-04 00:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055128, 578268, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hi, Aurelien, another picture of your girlfriend I see.  Nice slogan.  It doesn''t look as sharp as it should be, and with that Sony Alpha it should be sharper.</td>', 'Hi, Aurelien, another picture of your girlfriend I see.  Nice slogan.  It doesn''t look as sharp as it should be, and with that Sony Alpha it should be sharper.', '2007-09-04 00:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055129, 580399, 45475, '<td valign="top">Awesome dof. Interesting colours, well done.</td>', 'Awesome dof. Interesting colours, well done.', '2007-09-04 00:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055130, 578423, 45475, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.</td>', 'Simple and effective.', '2007-09-04 00:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055131, 580901, 41337, '<td valign="top">I normally like dark and dreary imagery but for this task I''m not sure that''s really the best way to go. Still I voted it favorably. Good luck.</td>', 'I normally like dark and dreary imagery but for this task I''m not sure that''s really the best way to go. Still I voted it favorably. Good luck.', '2007-09-04 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055133, 578575, 45475, '<td valign="top">Crisp, bold and interesting. Well done.</td>', 'Crisp, bold and interesting. Well done.', '2007-09-04 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055134, 580887, 45475, '<td valign="top">Good message and sweet capture :)</td>', 'Good message and sweet capture :)', '2007-09-04 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055135, 580655, 45475, '<td valign="top">Clever and original. Quote gets lost into the background though.</td>', 'Clever and original. Quote gets lost into the background though.', '2007-09-04 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055136, 580981, 45475, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, good layout.</td>', 'Lovely capture, good layout.', '2007-09-04 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055137, 581059, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the simplicity of the message and layout. Well done.</td>', 'Very cool. I love the simplicity of the message and layout. Well done.', '2007-09-04 00:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055139, 579402, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but to me the motivational saying is a little puzzling and not very motivational, unless gates is defined better.  Maybe something like "With the right key all barriers to success can be overcome."</td>', 'Nice picture, but to me the motivational saying is a little puzzling and not very motivational, unless gates is defined better.  Maybe something like "With the right key all barriers to success can be overcome."', '2007-09-04 00:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055147, 579402, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Good layout. Photo and phrase go well together. On top of that I don''t recall seeing a poster like this already printed so great job all around.</td>', 'Good photo. Good layout. Photo and phrase go well together. On top of that I don''t recall seeing a poster like this already printed so great job all around.', '2007-09-04 00:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055152, 580655, 76430, '<td valign="top">Actually I think he could have reached that light without the ladder.  Maybe pulled back some with the light a few feet higher would be more effective.  Good thought though.</td>', 'Actually I think he could have reached that light without the ladder.  Maybe pulled back some with the light a few feet higher would be more effective.  Good thought though.', '2007-09-04 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055171, 581053, 41337, '<td valign="top">It''s nothing like what an actual motivational poster would be. It''s noisy, the colors are strange and blotchy, the layout seems more like something used for a beer ad, yet overall it works. Well at least for me. If the shiny and framed posters belong in offices for white collar folks to look at this one undoubtably belongs stapled on a post for the working man.</td>', 'It''s nothing like what an actual motivational poster would be. It''s noisy, the colors are strange and blotchy, the layout seems more like something used for a beer ad, yet overall it works. Well at least for me. If the shiny and framed posters belong in offices for white collar folks to look at this one undoubtably belongs stapled on a post for the working man.', '2007-09-04 00:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055175, 580982, 41337, '<td valign="top">This glows. Doesn''t scream original but it''s hard to resist it''s charm.</td>', 'This glows. Doesn''t scream original but it''s hard to resist it''s charm.', '2007-09-04 00:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055177, 581019, 41337, '<td valign="top">Ha. Nice take on the challenge. Love the simplicity.</td>', 'Ha. Nice take on the challenge. Love the simplicity.', '2007-09-04 00:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055178, 579439, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  It looks like in this case the dream is pregnancy.  Is this an outtake from a professional shoot?</td>', 'Very nice picture.  It looks like in this case the dream is pregnancy.  Is this an outtake from a professional shoot?', '2007-09-04 00:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055182, 579021, 41337, '<td valign="top">I think I see half of Jesus'' face in that wall!</td>', 'I think I see half of Jesus'' face in that wall!', '2007-09-04 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055184, 580488, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2007-09-04 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055189, 580760, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the two images and the color scheme. The drop shadow messes with the zen potiental. It''s just a little too much, IMO.</td>', 'I like the two images and the color scheme. The drop shadow messes with the zen potiental. It''s just a little too much, IMO.', '2007-09-04 00:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055204, 580873, 41337, '<td valign="top">That is one crazy looking candle!</td>', 'That is one crazy looking candle!', '2007-09-04 01:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055207, 580785, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m puzzled.  Besides the singular/plural mismatch is this a human being?  Nice sharp picture of the subject.</td>', 'I''m puzzled.  Besides the singular/plural mismatch is this a human being?  Nice sharp picture of the subject.', '2007-09-04 01:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055214, 580964, 76430, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed and not very motivational.</td>', 'Overprocessed and not very motivational.', '2007-09-04 01:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055217, 579490, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture and a decent saying (said three times) to go along with it.  8</td>', 'Excellent picture and a decent saying (said three times) to go along with it.  8', '2007-09-04 01:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055230, 581065, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is an alcohol ad, an AA ''quit alcohol'' ad, or if the bottle shouldn''t even be there and it''s about succeeding.  What''s with the blurred label on the JB bottle?  If it''s about ''quit alcohol'', which seems most likely, it would be better if the bottle was open, upside down in a wire trash can with a pool of brown liquid under it.  Still a good enough shot for a 7.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is an alcohol ad, an AA ''quit alcohol'' ad, or if the bottle shouldn''t even be there and it''s about succeeding.  What''s with the blurred label on the JB bottle?  If it''s about ''quit alcohol'', which seems most likely, it would be better if the bottle was open, upside down in a wire trash can with a pool of brown liquid under it.  Still a good enough shot for a 7.', '2007-09-04 01:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055235, 581041, 68573, '<td valign="top">Great image</td>', 'Great image', '2007-09-04 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055249, 579508, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the rays! Not an easy task.</td>', 'Nice capture of the rays! Not an easy task.', '2007-09-04 01:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055252, 578137, 45475, '<td valign="top">Lovely poster. I like this idea, very sweet.</td>', 'Lovely poster. I like this idea, very sweet.', '2007-09-04 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055254, 580980, 45475, '<td valign="top">hehe... yes indeed. Good job!</td>', 'hehe... yes indeed. Good job!', '2007-09-04 01:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055256, 579834, 76430, '<td valign="top">I understand the intent is don''t wait for opportunity, do something to make it happen.  It might be good to have a door in the picture, or to more literally interpret the title, a blank wall.</td>', 'I understand the intent is don''t wait for opportunity, do something to make it happen.  It might be good to have a door in the picture, or to more literally interpret the title, a blank wall.', '2007-09-04 01:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055261, 579748, 45475, '<td valign="top">Awesome cloud cover! What I''d give for the same dramatic opportunity. Well done.</td>', 'Awesome cloud cover! What I''d give for the same dramatic opportunity. Well done.', '2007-09-04 01:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055263, 580819, 45475, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. It''s almost a shame to have the text cover any part of it, but I''m glad you chose to keep it small and out of the way somewhat. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot. It''s almost a shame to have the text cover any part of it, but I''m glad you chose to keep it small and out of the way somewhat. Well done.', '2007-09-04 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055265, 579608, 45475, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and I like the execution. Great job.</td>', 'I like the idea and I like the execution. Great job.', '2007-09-04 01:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
