(4055921, 578861, 56828, '<td valign="top">Love the shot.  Great text added.  Would have liked to have seen her feet or just more of the entire body in the frame.  The black and white adds dynamics to the photo.</td>', 'Love the shot.  Great text added.  Would have liked to have seen her feet or just more of the entire body in the frame.  The black and white adds dynamics to the photo.', '2007-09-04 09:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4055926, 581041, 56828, '<td valign="top">This photo is great.  It would have been much better and fitting of the challenge had you put the words on the actual photo or in the border (I''m not taking any points off of it at all though.)</td>', 'This photo is great.  It would have been much better and fitting of the challenge had you put the words on the actual photo or in the border (I''m not taking any points off of it at all though.)', '2007-09-04 09:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
