(4055961, 580386, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think the wording on your photo makes it too busy.  I think if you extended the photo on the left, added a border, or just used smaller font, it would have made it less busy.</td>', 'I think the wording on your photo makes it too busy.  I think if you extended the photo on the left, added a border, or just used smaller font, it would have made it less busy.', '2007-09-04 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
