(4056828, 580873, 49109, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge, good idea for a visualization of the topic, though the image itself is not too attracting. the typeface  really is a crime - I understand that you wanted to play with the shape of the candle and candleholder, but it is hardly readable and has that computer-stoneage-look.</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge, good idea for a visualization of the topic, though the image itself is not too attracting. the typeface  really is a crime - I understand that you wanted to play with the shape of the candle and candleholder, but it is hardly readable and has that computer-stoneage-look.', '2007-09-04 14:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4056844, 580766, 78021, '<td valign="top">Great poster.  the only thing I would change is to move the A and E closer to the rest of the word "Attitude".  One of my faves!</td>', 'Great poster.  the only thing I would change is to move the A and E closer to the rest of the word "Attitude".  One of my faves!', '2007-09-04 14:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4056850, 581053, 78021, '<td valign="top">How can you call that optimism...that glass is half empty! ;-)  <br/> <br/>Seriously though, interesting picture for the title, the glass is a bit dark though, maybe better with some back-lighting. (bright glass more optimistic than dark one?)</td>', 'How can you call that optimism...that glass is half empty! ;-)   Seriously though, interesting picture for the title, the glass is a bit dark though, maybe better with some back-lighting. (bright glass more optimistic than dark one?)', '2007-09-04 14:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4056861, 581015, 78021, '<td valign="top">The white text on the white reflection is difficult to read.  A drop-shaddow or outline on the text would make it easier to read, or put the text on the boarder?</td>', 'The white text on the white reflection is difficult to read.  A drop-shaddow or outline on the text would make it easier to read, or put the text on the boarder?', '2007-09-04 14:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
