(4058579, 580517, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good borders and sentiment. Seems to call for a view that shows only one best car to go with the statement. The one in the background clutters and distracts (but you got an excellent exposure on that one, shiny and saturated color with a few specular highlights). I wish the yellow car could have less white highlight on the right end of the hood, and that the brand name lettering could have looked all chrome instead of half greenery.</td>', 'Good borders and sentiment. Seems to call for a view that shows only one best car to go with the statement. The one in the background clutters and distracts (but you got an excellent exposure on that one, shiny and saturated color with a few specular highlights). I wish the yellow car could have less white highlight on the right end of the hood, and that the brand name lettering could have looked all chrome instead of half greenery.', '2007-09-04 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4058582, 580981, 81362, '<td valign="top">Design matches expectations for this kind of poster. Wish the giraffe could have been stretching out for a leafy bransh, to better communicate "strive".</td>', 'Design matches expectations for this kind of poster. Wish the giraffe could have been stretching out for a leafy bransh, to better communicate "strive".', '2007-09-04 23:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4058586, 579173, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice exposer and sentiment. Hope you aren''t voted down too low by those who demand big dark borders for all motivational posters.</td>', 'Nice exposer and sentiment. Hope you aren''t voted down too low by those who demand big dark borders for all motivational posters.', '2007-09-04 23:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4058608, 580946, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and coloring. Would have been interesting to omit the right hand yellow line to let the eye anticipate a longer race. Image would fit better with an anti-procrastination sentiment ("Without that first step, you never get anywhere" comes to mind, but also illustrates how hard it is to be good at writing such stuff.</td>', 'Nice exposure and coloring. Would have been interesting to omit the right hand yellow line to let the eye anticipate a longer race. Image would fit better with an anti-procrastination sentiment ("Without that first step, you never get anywhere" comes to mind, but also illustrates how hard it is to be good at writing such stuff.', '2007-09-04 23:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4058635, 579402, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the image, the border, and the main idea. Knocked down a point for the explantory wording, which demotivates.</td>', 'I like the image, the border, and the main idea. Knocked down a point for the explantory wording, which demotivates.', '2007-09-04 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
