(4061604, 579021, 53998, '<td valign="top">HAHA, great shot of a brick wall, funny title. I would love to see one where one brick is missing and someone is peering through, to give a bit of hope to those who have that creative block.</td>', 'HAHA, great shot of a brick wall, funny title. I would love to see one where one brick is missing and someone is peering through, to give a bit of hope to those who have that creative block.', '2007-09-05 13:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
