(4062046, 579021, 56828, '<td valign="top">haha...i think the words are hilarious.  I just hope my shot does better than this one....lol</td>', 'haha...i think the words are hilarious.  I just hope my shot does better than this one....lol', '2007-09-05 15:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
