(4062219, 581075, 13879, '<td valign="top">I didnt enter this challenge, but i am looking forward to the roll-over just to see the sort of comments that you get! I am expecting an inverse bell-curve for you! But as a show of solidarity I gave you a 10 - Good luck!</td>', 'I didnt enter this challenge, but i am looking forward to the roll-over just to see the sort of comments that you get! I am expecting an inverse bell-curve for you! But as a show of solidarity I gave you a 10 - Good luck!', '2007-09-05 16:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062352, 580700, 67237, '<td valign="top">Too bad the text is so hard to read.  Not calibrated monitor?<br/>It is a great photo though</td>', 'Too bad the text is so hard to read.  Not calibrated monitor?It is a great photo though', '2007-09-05 17:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062354, 579173, 67237, '<td valign="top">Great Photo. Unfortunately the graphic design does not stand up at its level. But since this is a digital PHOTO site I will not kill you for that.</td>', 'Great Photo. Unfortunately the graphic design does not stand up at its level. But since this is a digital PHOTO site I will not kill you for that.', '2007-09-05 17:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062515, 580006, 56243, '<td valign="top">Maybe try it with the old side shadowed that way it''ll look more real and less like theator makeup.  Otherwise this is a great idea, the method of lighting just bugs me.</td>', 'Maybe try it with the old side shadowed that way it''ll look more real and less like theator makeup.  Otherwise this is a great idea, the method of lighting just bugs me.', '2007-09-05 18:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062523, 580962, 56243, '<td valign="top">maybe make the color in the flower a bit more vibrant and less flat feeling.  It''s a beautiful flower with tons of folds, show them off.</td>', 'maybe make the color in the flower a bit more vibrant and less flat feeling.  It''s a beautiful flower with tons of folds, show them off.', '2007-09-05 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062547, 581035, 56243, '<td valign="top">Is this a homeless person, or someone taking a break after a long walk or did she fall or was she mugged?  It''s a nice cropping but if you''re wanting to encourage or motivate the reader it has to have a defined story and this one leaves too many possibilities.  Also, if it''s a picture of a homeless person and your message is go to college that seems a bit judgemental doesn''t it?  I mean you don''t know the circumstances of the persons life.  They may have a degree and had a bad card dealt to them in life and lost everything.  College doesn''t hold all the answers.  However, because I kindof like the crop and to show I''m not a completely hartless person I''m giving you a 6</td>', 'Is this a homeless person, or someone taking a break after a long walk or did she fall or was she mugged?  It''s a nice cropping but if you''re wanting to encourage or motivate the reader it has to have a defined story and this one leaves too many possibilities.  Also, if it''s a picture of a homeless person and your message is go to college that seems a bit judgemental doesn''t it?  I mean you don''t know the circumstances of the persons life.  They may have a degree and had a bad card dealt to them in life and lost everything.  College doesn''t hold all the answers.  However, because I kindof like the crop and to show I''m not a completely hartless person I''m giving you a 6', '2007-09-05 18:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062551, 580302, 56243, '<td valign="top">very nicely done.  I love the structure of the stairs.  I havent seen buildings that have this form of stairwells in a long time.</td>', 'very nicely done.  I love the structure of the stairs.  I havent seen buildings that have this form of stairwells in a long time.', '2007-09-05 18:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
