(4065481, 580276, 53998, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but not a very motivational title, one thing I have learned in my time in the service is that the duel blade choppers defy the science of flight, in that the blades are supposed to cancel out lift between one another. Maybe for the title it would have been better to put something like "When we deny all the rules that bind us to this earth we will truly learn to fly" or something like that. Also food for thought on photographing aircraft, always try to capture the movment of the blades, usually dropping your shutter speed to something like 1/250 through 1/100 just to give enough motion blur to recognize the aircraft is flying and not falling.</td>', 'Great shot, but not a very motivational title, one thing I have learned in my time in the service is that the duel blade choppers defy the science of flight, in that the blades are supposed to cancel out lift between one another. Maybe for the title it would have been better to put something like "When we deny all the rules that bind us to this earth we will truly learn to fly" or something like that. Also food for thought on photographing aircraft, always try to capture the movment of the blades, usually dropping your shutter speed to something like 1/250 through 1/100 just to give enough motion blur to recognize the aircraft is flying and not falling.', '2007-09-06 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065485, 580974, 53998, '<td valign="top">The pastel colors really draw me in to this shot, good work!</td>', 'The pastel colors really draw me in to this shot, good work!', '2007-09-06 14:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065545, 578914, 83845, '<td valign="top">I love the humor in this one, but not real keen on the lighting.  I would have like to have seen more shadows (depth).</td>', 'I love the humor in this one, but not real keen on the lighting.  I would have like to have seen more shadows (depth).', '2007-09-06 14:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
