(4072829, 579402, 60862, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo.  The words don''t make sense to me, though.  First, keys aren''t locked.  Second, gates don''t usually bar the way to keys.  Rather, lacking a key can mean you can''t open a gate.</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo.  The words don''t make sense to me, though.  First, keys aren''t locked.  Second, gates don''t usually bar the way to keys.  Rather, lacking a key can mean you can''t open a gate.', '2007-09-08 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073081, 580006, 83577, '<td valign="top">Kind of scary...more than just age...kind of looks like she had a grilling accident...lol but neat mingling of effects.</td>', 'Kind of scary...more than just age...kind of looks like she had a grilling accident...lol but neat mingling of effects.', '2007-09-08 20:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
