(4073214, 579758, 41675, '<td valign="top">Although I''m not crazy about the choice of font for the header on the left, I like seeing it run vertically. It''s a nice change from all the other entries.</td>', 'Although I''m not crazy about the choice of font for the header on the left, I like seeing it run vertically. It''s a nice change from all the other entries.', '2007-09-08 21:22:39.000000', NULL, 1);
