(4073238, 578137, 80278, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the meaning of the quote. Aren''t footprints a good thing? As in following in someone''s footsteps...<br/>Nice angle.</td>', 'I don''t understand the meaning of the quote. Aren''t footprints a good thing? As in following in someone''s footsteps...Nice angle.', '2007-09-08 21:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
