(4073266, 580982, 80278, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but don''t care for the dead center shot. More efffective would be to snap the bird right or left.</td>', 'Lovely, but don''t care for the dead center shot. More efffective would be to snap the bird right or left.', '2007-09-08 21:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
