(4074465, 581098, 25355, '<td valign="top">I recognise this scene. Good quote (and Mozart just happens to be playing in the background as I vote. ;-Þ)</td>', 'I recognise this scene. Good quote (and Mozart just happens to be playing in the background as I vote. ;-Þ)', '2007-09-09 08:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074471, 580302, 25355, '<td valign="top">That bugs me, using the apostrophe so flagrantly where it''s not needed...</td>', 'That bugs me, using the apostrophe so flagrantly where it''s not needed...', '2007-09-09 08:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074528, 581090, 38032, '<td valign="top">This looks like it''s from some sort of weird science fiction movie where women have been redefined  - distilled to a primary purpose in the superficial eyes of the provider of "seed".  The alternate poster would maybe have signs of male extinction and females generating their own "seed" from ... let''s say the stem cells of oysters.  I personally am torn because I don''t want to judge it on moral grounds - in case it is meant to be tongue in cheek.  no vote here  -but good luck getting this past women voters (it will be interesting to see how many 1''s this gets).</td>', 'This looks like it''s from some sort of weird science fiction movie where women have been redefined  - distilled to a primary purpose in the superficial eyes of the provider of "seed".  The alternate poster would maybe have signs of male extinction and females generating their own "seed" from ... let''s say the stem cells of oysters.  I personally am torn because I don''t want to judge it on moral grounds - in case it is meant to be tongue in cheek.  no vote here  -but good luck getting this past women voters (it will be interesting to see how many 1''s this gets).', '2007-09-09 09:14:49.000000', NULL, 1);
