(4075206, 579575, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think your job, though, is to help us see that dream, by showing the rock pile in an interesting light.  I think that the light here is too flat to encourage that dream.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think your job, though, is to help us see that dream, by showing the rock pile in an interesting light.  I think that the light here is too flat to encourage that dream.', '2007-09-09 15:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
