(4075216, 580996, 30508, '<td valign="top">The color seems a little off here.  You might check your white balance.  Also, I''m not following how the text and the image go together, unless you meant "just <b>bee</b> yourself" (sorry for the bad pun).  Otherwise, I think you''ve captured a really neat moment between the bee and the flowers.</td>', 'The color seems a little off here.  You might check your white balance.  Also, I''m not following how the text and the image go together, unless you meant "just bee yourself" (sorry for the bad pun).  Otherwise, I think you''ve captured a really neat moment between the bee and the flowers.', '2007-09-09 15:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075218, 580491, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I love the textures in the sky as well.  The text seems a little plain and strangely spaced out.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I love the textures in the sky as well.  The text seems a little plain and strangely spaced out.', '2007-09-09 15:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
