(4075236, 579748, 5112, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sky!  I am having a bit of trouble getting the connection of the image to the concept of "perseverance".  The image itself might work a tad better if the barn weren''t placed so dead centre.</td>', 'Fantastic sky!  I am having a bit of trouble getting the connection of the image to the concept of "perseverance".  The image itself might work a tad better if the barn weren''t placed so dead centre.', '2007-09-09 16:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075241, 579402, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very interesting poster.  Just looking at it is a joy, it''s a beautiful image, and the poster is well designed.  I see no problems with it.  That said, I find the picture of a chained and locked gate sort of like the opposite of the message - sort of like you''re showing how to not achieve success, rather than how to achieve success.</td>', 'Very interesting poster.  Just looking at it is a joy, it''s a beautiful image, and the poster is well designed.  I see no problems with it.  That said, I find the picture of a chained and locked gate sort of like the opposite of the message - sort of like you''re showing how to not achieve success, rather than how to achieve success.', '2007-09-09 16:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075245, 579490, 5112, '<td valign="top">Sherpet I presume?  Good image, it looks good on black.  However, I think you went a bit overboard with the message, once below the image would have been enough (plus, if you re-edit, it should be "Natur<b>e''s</b> World" and "peace, harmony, and love <b>make</b> (not makes) this world a better place"</td>', 'Sherpet I presume?  Good image, it looks good on black.  However, I think you went a bit overboard with the message, once below the image would have been enough (plus, if you re-edit, it should be "Nature''s World" and "peace, harmony, and love make (not makes) this world a better place"', '2007-09-09 16:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075247, 581065, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good message, nicely done.  IMHO it would be better without the rounding at the edges.</td>', 'Good message, nicely done.  IMHO it would be better without the rounding at the edges.', '2007-09-09 16:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
