(4075630, 578212, 62787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, with a certain mystical quality to it. I love the composition, the low key feel, and the geometry of the banister that draws you into itself. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, with a certain mystical quality to it. I love the composition, the low key feel, and the geometry of the banister that draws you into itself. 10', '2007-09-09 19:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
