(4075794, 578953, 41337, '<td valign="top">The photo is a little bland looking and the foreground grass is too prominent, IMO. I think if the dog had some more fill light on it or dodged some in post it would work a little better. I do like the quote and you did a good job placing it against the darker background.</td>', 'The photo is a little bland looking and the foreground grass is too prominent, IMO. I think if the dog had some more fill light on it or dodged some in post it would work a little better. I do like the quote and you did a good job placing it against the darker background.', '2007-09-09 21:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075807, 580488, 41337, '<td valign="top">Where did you get large tennis balls like that? Photo and text could be better but overall very effective.</td>', 'Where did you get large tennis balls like that? Photo and text could be better but overall very effective.', '2007-09-09 21:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075833, 579021, 50695, '<td valign="top">10 for one hell of a good laugh (and to help you whop as many people as possible, including me)</td>', '10 for one hell of a good laugh (and to help you whop as many people as possible, including me)', '2007-09-09 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
