(4076919, 579402, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a personal best, Joe! Great job! Without having read any of the comments yet, I am guessing it suffered more from the message than the image itself. Well done though!</td>', 'Congrats on a personal best, Joe! Great job! Without having read any of the comments yet, I am guessing it suffered more from the message than the image itself. Well done though!', '2007-09-10 04:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
