(4078481, 579608, 83080, '<td valign="top">Yippee!  I''m glad to get closer to the -6- range.  Thanks to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> for noting that the flare is an important symbol.  I was also thinking of the light as a temptation. Sometimes we are drawn to that glorious/bright path when the better choice might be less well illuminated &amp; clear.<br/> <br/>I also intend to follow up on many of the suggestions regarding font, lighting and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=29011" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">techo</a>''s idea to try keeping it in color.  I am going to print this one for my classroom, so I want to refine it some more.<br/> <br/>Thanks All.</td>', 'Yippee!  I''m glad to get closer to the -6- range.  Thanks to  posthumous for noting that the flare is an important symbol.  I was also thinking of the light as a temptation. Sometimes we are drawn to that glorious/bright path when the better choice might be less well illuminated & clear. I also intend to follow up on many of the suggestions regarding font, lighting and  techo''s idea to try keeping it in color.  I am going to print this one for my classroom, so I want to refine it some more. Thanks All.', '2007-09-10 16:28:38.000000', NULL, 0),
