(4080331, 579343, 47483, '<td valign="top">from the thumbnail it looks interesting picture, so this is good point about it. However when it opened, viewer (at least me) loses interest in it. Why , because I can not find a place where i could see you might have focused. all image look soft. If it were little bit more sharper, it might have scored little better. You could try sharpening it and see yourself how it looks. I will download it and see it myself though.</td>', 'from the thumbnail it looks interesting picture, so this is good point about it. However when it opened, viewer (at least me) loses interest in it. Why , because I can not find a place where i could see you might have focused. all image look soft. If it were little bit more sharper, it might have scored little better. You could try sharpening it and see yourself how it looks. I will download it and see it myself though.', '2007-09-11 07:18:59.000000', NULL, 0),
