(4098379, 580017, 47483, '<td valign="top">You have asked ''what you could have done better''. This is my personal view. This photo is very good photo. I could not think of any flaw in it. Very good.<br/>There is just a small problem, it does not motivate me (enough)<br/>and probably this is the reason it did not score higher. <br/> <br/>ps: My own photo was not good in this challenge. But I was not serious towards this challenge. <br/></td>', 'You have asked ''what you could have done better''. This is my personal view. This photo is very good photo. I could not think of any flaw in it. Very good.There is just a small problem, it does not motivate me (enough)and probably this is the reason it did not score higher.  ps: My own photo was not good in this challenge. But I was not serious towards this challenge. ', '2007-09-18 06:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098412, 581019, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really liked the concept of this one a great deal, but I really think the thing that ended up hurting the score was the choice of black and white.  <br/> <br/>You did a nice job with the converstion to b/w, but motivational posters are usually in color and food type images really scream of good color.  By putting it in color, we would be able to find the cookie more appetizing and we would see better contrast between the cookie and the milk.  I ended up giving it a 5 because it just missed the mark - in color I easily would have bumped it up to at least a 7.<br/> <br/>Also, the milk seems to be slightly underexposed as if the lighting was not even.  I saw your outtake and that looked a whole lot better.</td>', 'i really liked the concept of this one a great deal, but I really think the thing that ended up hurting the score was the choice of black and white.   You did a nice job with the converstion to b/w, but motivational posters are usually in color and food type images really scream of good color.  By putting it in color, we would be able to find the cookie more appetizing and we would see better contrast between the cookie and the milk.  I ended up giving it a 5 because it just missed the mark - in color I easily would have bumped it up to at least a 7. Also, the milk seems to be slightly underexposed as if the lighting was not even.  I saw your outtake and that looked a whole lot better.', '2007-09-18 07:40:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4099106, 579710, 35720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by routerguy666:</b></div><hr/><i> Critique Club feedback -<br/> <br/>The photo carries this poster,and obviously carried it right to the top 10.  Really super shot.<br/> <br/>Probably the only reason this didn''t climb all the way to top 3 is the font.  The  message is a bit small (the photo is there to reinforce the messsage, not the other way around) and the font is lackluster.  Also the white font and border is rather jarring against the wonderful muted tones of the photo itself.<br/> <br/>Great shot, and it scored very well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot Router for your good critique, I totally agree with you.</td>', 'Originally posted by routerguy666: Critique Club feedback - The photo carries this poster,and obviously carried it right to the top 10.  Really super shot. Probably the only reason this didn''t climb all the way to top 3 is the font.  The  message is a bit small (the photo is there to reinforce the messsage, not the other way around) and the font is lackluster.  Also the white font and border is rather jarring against the wonderful muted tones of the photo itself. Great shot, and it scored very well.   Thanks a lot Router for your good critique, I totally agree with you.', '2007-09-18 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
